{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwZEbcXBcZmi31753qsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built the dashboard and created the alert rule, and the rule is enabled. Its status is `ok`, which means its first run went through without errors. It hasn't fired yet, and I haven't checked that its query actually picks out 5xx requests.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** The data view `Kibana Sample Data Logs` uses `timestamp` as its time field. Each document is one web request, with these main fields:\n- **Response code:** `response`, a text field with a `response.keyword` copy for exact matching.\n- **Request details:** `request`, `url` and `extension`.\n- **Size:** `bytes`.\n- **Who sent it:** `clientip`, `agent` and `machine.os`.\n- **Where from:** `geo.src`, `geo.dest` and `geo.coordinates`.\n- **Other:** `host`, `referer` and `tags`.\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-dda01666 Web logs overview\"** has 7 panels: http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-dda01666-web-logs-overview-f988437176ea\n- Three single numbers: total requests, unique visitors (distinct `clientip`) and total bytes served.\n- A bar chart of requests over time, split by response code.\n- A pie chart of how requests divide across response codes.\n- A table of the top 10 URLs, with request count and average bytes.\n- A bar chart of requests by operating system.\n\n**3. Alert rule \"EFF-dda01666 5xx spike\"** (id `2f75d388-805e-46bb-aca3-cffef3c55602`):\n- It's an Elasticsearch query rule on `kibana_sample_data_logs` and runs every minute.\n- It counts requests whose `response.keyword` starts with \"5\" in the last 5 minutes, using the `timestamp` field.\n- It fires when that count is more than 10.\n- It has no notification connector, so when it fires the alert shows up in Kibana but nobody gets a message."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":20516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":343},"output_tokens":647,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4eb1cb7-866c-5bbf-8d81-a8d5acd83be3","uuid":"ecad5da2-0860-4bb7-9661-ad387f0d6998","timestamp":"2026-10-12T02:30:18.107Z","request_id":"req_011CfwZEbPsZxg9CpLg2jmV2"}
